WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.728
If you take one thing
away, take the checklist,

2
00:00:02.728 --> 00:00:06.275
because it turns the whole guide
into things you can verify.

3
00:00:06.275 --> 00:00:09.976
It runs across eight areas,
from ownership and inventory,

4
00:00:09.976 --> 00:00:14.937
through change safety and credentials,
to evidence and the platform itself.

5
00:00:14.937 --> 00:00:17.067
Each item is phrased as done when,

6
00:00:17.067 --> 00:00:20.300
so it works as a review gate
rather than a reminder.

7
00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:21.825
You've seen most of it today.

8
00:00:21.825 --> 00:00:26.769
The items teams skip are the quiet ones:
requiring a second run with no changes,

9
00:00:26.769 --> 00:00:30.013
and never counting an
unreached host as compliant.

10
00:00:30.013 --> 00:00:31.870
Let's finish with the decisions.
